-4153-8a72-fba38e7ead69\" />\n\nThey should also respect the View > Gizmos > NavigationObstacle3D and View > Gizmos > NavigationRegion3D visibility toggles\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a `NavigationObstacle3D`\n- Increase its radius\n- Enable avoidance\n- Disable View Gizmos and notice that the avoidance radius is still visible\n\nSetting up a navigation region is a bit more complicated, so please use the MRP\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe issue is not project-specific, but here is an MRP\n[navigation-gizmos.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30074756/navigation-gizmos.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}